eU\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d349aa470011WucMTEncjDtaj\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_16883428b7f64a72a2ce482b\",\"tool\":\"edit\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\",\"oldString\":\"It then runs six read-only legs once: the sk-code setup battery, the sk-git setup battery, the trigger index freshness check, the runtime mirror check, the advisor status probe with `--warm-only` and the embedder check, which reads the semantic lane and the command vectors.\\nIt reports each leg as passing, skipped, degraded or failing.\",\"newString\":\"It then runs seven read-only legs once: the sk-code setup battery, the sk-git setup battery, the trigger index freshness check, the runtime mirror check, the advisor status probe with `--warm-only` and the embedder check, which reads the semantic lane and the command vectors, and the delivery check, which reads whether each runtime's prompt hook is wired and whether Codex has approved it.\\nThe delivery leg reports DEGRADED, never FAIL, when a prompt hook is missing or the Codex hook is unapproved, and names the repair.\\nIt reports each leg as passing, skipped, degraded or failing.\"},\"output\":\"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md (1 replacement)\",\"title\":\"edit\",\"metadata\":{\"metadata\":{\"files\":[{\"file\":\".skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\",\"patch\":\"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\\n===================================================================\\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\\n@@ -58,9 +58,10 @@\\n \\n ## 6. WORKFLOW SUMMARY\\n \\n The workflow prints the doctor target list.\\n-It then runs six read-only legs once: the sk-code setup battery, the sk-git setup battery, the trigger index freshness check, the runtime mirror check, the advisor status probe with `--warm-only` and the embedder...\n  Line 21: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794546195051,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2cb7c666ffeHkmmUEjhPLtm