ctor:speckit` to see which documents are stale |\n+| The delivery leg reports DEGRADED | A runtime cannot receive the advisor brief. Run the repair the leg names, then rerun /doctor:setup. The install still works without it |\n | Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\n \n End interactive presentations with: `What would you like to do next?`\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"| The delivery leg reports DEGRADED | A runtime cannot receive the advisor brief. Run the repair the leg names, then rerun /doctor:setup. The install still works without it |\\n| Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\",\"oldString\":\"| Route manifest parse error | Run `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh` |\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794546258623,"end":1794546261124}}}}
