{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546458382,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c22dffeZNysJSTmWyN01Q","part":{"id":"prt_1d34dd45d002Q6111m0v3Klqkt","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c22dffeZNysJSTmWyN01Q","messageID":"msg_1d34dbc28001C8kSgDu7qfdJOw","type":"text","text":"T016 complete. All three edits are in `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt`:\n\n- `the six read-only setup legs` → `the seven read-only setup legs`\n- added `| delivery | Missing hook: ... |` after the `embedder` repair row\n- added `| The delivery leg reports DEGRADED | ... |` before the route-manifest troubleshooting row\n\nVerify output:\n\n```\n$ rg -c \"seven read-only setup legs\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt\n1\n$ rg -c \"^\\| delivery \\|\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt\n1\n$ node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/*.test.cjs\nℹ tests 1164\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 1164\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\n```\n\n`git diff` for that path shows only the three hunks above. Checkbox left unticked as instructed.\n\nOne judgment call: the delivery row uses the literal text from the task line, without backticks around the commands, while the neighbouring rows quote commands. Say the word if you want them quoted.\n\nNothing is blocked on the operator.","time":{"start":1794546455645,"end":1794546458382}}}
